NoteReading the scores





Seven criteria scored 1–5; composite is their mean. Accuracy, Uniqueness, Timeliness, Transparency/bias, Verifiability, Acs = accessibility, Depth. Perspective labels are disclosure, not quality; the gold dataset tag marks quantitative sources (see Datasets). This is a starter set for Bosnia and Herzegovina — it can be deepened on request. See the Methodology.

